      <p class="loc-seo__cta">To get a quotation for Forward Curved Centrifugal Fans in Bengaluru, share your airflow, pressure and application details through our <a href="../contact.php" title="Contact Fan Air India">contact page</a>, call <a href="tel:+919811347199" title="Call Fan Air India">+91-9811347199</a> or email <a href="mailto:saurabh.joshi@fanair.in" title="Email Fan Air India">saurabh.joshi@fanair.in</a>.</p>
